      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "En Nihoa pasó algo más. El hermano menor, Kāneʻapua, había cargado demasiado la proa.",
          "en": "Something else happened at Nihoa. The youngest brother, Kāneʻapua, had loaded the front of the canoe too heavily."
        },
        {
          "es": "La canoa se hundía de punta en las olas. Kamohoaliʻi se enojó y lo dejó en la roca.",
          "en": "The canoe dipped its nose into the waves. Kamohoaliʻi got angry and left him on the rock."
        },
        {
          "es": "Siguieron hasta otra isla chiquita, que luego se llamaría Lehua, como la flor roja.",
          "en": "They sailed on to another tiny island, later called Lehua, like the red flower."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero Pele se acordó del hermanito. «Qué pena me da», dijo.",
          "en": "But Pele thought of their little brother. \"I feel so sorry for him,\" she said."
        },
        {
          "es": "Kamohoaliʻi dio vuelta la canoa, y volvieron a buscarlo.",
          "en": "So Kamohoaliʻi turned the canoe around, and they went back for him."
        }
      ],
