      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Los hawaianos dicen que esos cráteres de Oʻahu son pozos viejos de Pele.",
          "en": "Hawaiians say those craters on Oʻahu are old pits of Pele."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y es cierto que esas colinas nacieron del fuego, hace muchísimo tiempo.",
          "en": "And it is true that those hills were born from fire, a very long time ago."
        },
        {
          "es": "Hoy son volcanes dormidos. Ya no queda fuego adentro.",
          "en": "Today they are sleeping volcanoes. No fire is left inside."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pele no estaba contenta. Necesitaba una tierra donde su fuego pudiera vivir para siempre.",
          "en": "Pele was not happy. She needed a land where her fire could live forever."
        },
        {
          "es": "¿Tú habrías seguido cavando, o te habrías rendido?",
          "en": "Would you have kept on digging, or given up?"
        }
